        "_%n issued certificate will be rebuilt and signed again._::_%n issued certificates will be rebuilt and signed again._": ["%n issued certificate will be rebuilt and signed again.","%n issued certificates will be rebuilt and signed again."],
        "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import', 'lvs-results'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'lvs-results' (direction:import) hands a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed-result pull to the OpenConnector source configuration; the matching DataMappingProfile maps the incoming record onto LvsResult, which lands as 'imported' and awaits coordinator verification (lvs-import-contract). Scholiq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/UWLR/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.": "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import', 'lvs-results'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'lvs-results' (direction:import) hands a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed-result pull to the OpenConnector source configuration; the matching DataMappingProfile maps the incoming record onto LvsResult, which lands as 'imported' and awaits coordinator verification (lvs-import-contract). Scholiq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/UWLR/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.",
        "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | lvs-results | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Scholiq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'lvs-results' (direction:import) resolves a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed result into an LvsResult, per lvs-import-contract.": "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | lvs-results | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Scholiq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'lvs-results' (direction:import) resolves a UWLR-carried Cito/IEP/Boom/Dia normed result into an LvsResult, per lvs-import-contract.",
        "Emergency contacts to reach when no guardian in guardianRefs is reachable, e.g. a grandparent or neighbour with no Scholiq identity of their own (finding G-new-12). Ordered by priority; the first entry is called first.": "Emergency contacts to reach when no guardian in guardianRefs is reachable, e.g. a grandparent or neighbour with no Scholiq identity of their own (finding G-new-12). Ordered by priority; the first entry is called first.",
        "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'oso' with direction:import receives an incoming PO→VO overstapdossier; the matching DataMappingProfile resolves it into an OsoImportDossier held for coordinator review before acceptance (oso-inbound-contract) — the existing direction:export path (OsoDossierReviewGuard's parent-review gate) is unchanged. Scholiq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.": "Named OpenConnector connection (e.g. 'bron-rod', 'oso', 'leerplicht', 'surfconext', 'hr', 'swv', 'ooapi-catalog', 'timetable-import'). 'swv' routes a zorgvraag/TLV-chain dossier (learning-plan's SupportRequest) to the regional samenwerkingsverband (openconnector#753). 'ooapi-catalog' syncs a published/archived Course, Programme, or Cohort to the OOAPI 5.0 course catalog hosted by opencatalogi, per the course-management publication contract (course → course, program → program, offering → offering). 'timetable-import' (direction:import) hands a generated-timetable pull to the OpenConnector Zermelo/Untis/Xedule source configuration; TimetableImportHandler resolves the response via the matching DataMappingProfile into idempotent Session upserts keyed by externalRef, then triggers TimetableConflictDetector's batch scan (timetabling-and-substitution). 'oso' with direction:import receives an incoming PO→VO overstapdossier; the matching DataMappingProfile resolves it into an OsoImportDossier held for coordinator review before acceptance (oso-inbound-contract) — the existing direction:export path (OsoDossierReviewGuard's parent-review gate) is unchanged. Scholiq implements no Edukoppeling/StUF/OSO-XML/Digikoppeling/SAML/OOAPI/Zermelo/Untis/Xedule wire code — all protocol logic lives in OpenConnector.",
        "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Scholiq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'oso' with direction:import resolves an incoming overstapdossier into an OsoImportDossier held for coordinator review, per oso-inbound-contract.": "Named OpenConnector connection: bron-rod | oso | leerplicht | surfconext | hr | swv | timetable-import | or a custom name. This is a reference to an OpenConnector source/target configuration — Scholiq implements no wire protocol. 'timetable-import' (direction:import) resolves a Zermelo/Untis/Xedule-generated timetable into Session upserts, per timetabling-and-substitution. 'oso' with direction:import resolves an incoming overstapdossier into an OsoImportDossier held for coordinator review, per oso-inbound-contract.",
